\title{MultiSynSurr: synthetic surrogate regression with several synthetic phenotypes}
\description{
Association testing for a partially measured outcome that borrows strength
from one or more synthetic phenotypes, predictions of the outcome from
different surrogates, each available on its own subset of participants. The
main function is [msr()]; [msr_test()] tests a coefficient,
[msr_expected_ratio()] predicts the precision gain over complete-case
analysis and [msr_simulate()] generates example data.
